# author : Yashvi Sharma
# source : collecting area from LRIS2_ETC Telescope.keck, 723674 cm2 = 72.3674 m2
# date_created  : 2025-09-02
# date_modified : 2026-08-20
# status :
# type : mirror:list
# outer_unit : m
# inner_unit : m
# angle_unit : degree
# temperature_unit  : deg_C
# notes :
# - inner is set to 2.8034 m so that the annulus area matches the ETC value of 72.3674 m2.
# - that corresponds to the 7.9 percent central obscuration quoted by Telescope.keck.
# - it is NOT the physical diameter of any baffle, it is the equivalent-area obscuration.
# - SurfaceList.area takes the max over surfaces, so M1 and M2 carry the same aperture.
# changes :
# - 2026-08-20 (BPH) added M2, same aluminium coating as M1
# - 2026-08-21 (BPH) inner 1.0 -> 2.8034 m to match the ETC collecting area
#
name  outer  inner  angle  temperature  action         filename
M1    10.0    2.8034 0.     0           reflection     TC_mirror_aluminium.dat
M2    10.0    2.8034 0.     0           reflection     TC_mirror_aluminium.dat
